><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/3d8947dc0eece8f944f4ed229e5c6971.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/2ef0fd96d90a526300f22b013946ab86.avif?t=1752496006\" width=366 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune into the city's olden folklores through Kusum Dadi's stories every evening. <strong>Collect</strong>\u00a0and expand your collection of story cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/268aa34ffda118719f40da3081e489a7.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" width=706 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/268aa34ffda118719f40da3081e489a7.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/268aa34ffda118719f40da3081e489a7.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/333cdee4c78b4604704dac685a3be2f9.avif?t=1752496006\" width=366 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live carefree in a city filled with colorful graffiti, gorgeous temples and a vibrant culture.\u00a0Have fun in the weekly<strong>\u00a0mela</strong> (carnival), playing games and engaging with overseas' merchants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/5280aac6e3df138dcd33240666708c4c.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/44e1b34da7ed56c92c75fbdcae101e10.avif?t=1752496006\" width=366 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of creatively designed fun puzzles during your visit to the temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/52a404e27dd8785399f4c5958fa8e6dd.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/52a404e27dd8785399f4c5958fa8e6dd.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/52a404e27dd8785399f4c5958fa8e6dd.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/257aa5aa77f1eda15ca0b8caa01f7283.avif?t=1752496006\" width=366 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uplift your mood by playing little, relaxing games while laying on a bench, riding a boat or simply enjoy the still, cozy vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/f2b07758480a310215c58d41c475e9d8.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/f2b07758480a310215c58d41c475e9d8.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/f2b07758480a310215c58d41c475e9d8.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/74899a5912a5475c34e0cc8bfa15e622.avif?t=1752496006\" width=366 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the history of the ruined Chet Fort. Team-up with Historian Mohan, collect clues from around the city and unmask the quiet mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" width=740 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/88162bb2f091229861c6fc61682a70e4.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/fee0ca6ec776a0ece902c6cdb1401c78.avif?t=1752496006\" width=366 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek companionship with Siya, a fellow traveler and an artist. Go on dates, spend time together doing activities such as camel rides, exploring mela, decorating the city, or just a simple chai date along the riverbank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/d69fa0d5c9ebb8404328367f7fb5e45e.poster.avif?t=1752496006\" width=798 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/d69fa0d5c9ebb8404328367f7fb5e45e.webm?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/d69fa0d5c9ebb8404328367f7fb5e45e.mp4?t=1752496006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/2829b173013d6d9772d71bfde42b0fbd.webp?t=1752496006\" width=312 height=54 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A cozy adventure based on Om's travels to a city situated by the riverbank. Cook local cuisine, help folks with their daily chores, and solve the mystery of the ruined fort. Practice and play sitar to raise money for the big festival.",
